@api = http://localhost:5080

### Sign in (demo payroll admin; seeded in Development only)
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@timeledger.local", "password": "TimeLedger-Demo-2026" }

### Paste the accessToken from the response here
@token = <access token>

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Who is in right now (Redis-backed)
GET {{api}}/api/presence
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employees
GET {{api}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clock in — send twice with the same key: the second returns 200 with Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{api}}/api/clock-events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-punch-0001

{ "employeeId": "<employee id>", "type": "ClockIn", "source": "Web" }

### Pay periods
GET {{api}}/api/pay-periods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Live timesheet preview (open period) or frozen lines (closed period)
GET {{api}}/api/pay-periods/<period id>/timesheets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Close last month: freezes timesheets and publishes payroll.period_closed
POST {{api}}/api/pay-periods/<period id>/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Watch the deliveries (the mock provider fails ~30% with 503 to show retries)
GET {{api}}/api/deliveries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### What the mock payroll provider received
GET {{api}}/mock/payroll-provider/received
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pending leave
GET {{api}}/api/leave-requests?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Approve leave (publishes leave.approved to the HR webhook)
POST {{api}}/api/leave-requests/<leave id>/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
